        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Blade Barrage"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "Takatorra unleashes a flurry of attacks.\n\nTakatorra makes five melee Strikes. Their multiple attack penalty applies as normal. They gain a cumulative +2 circumstance bonus to damage for each successful Strike.\n\nIf one target is hit with at least two of these Strikes, they also take 2d6 persistent bleed damage. They then become stunned 1 and flat-footed until the start of their next turn."
            },
            "action_type": {
              "value": "none"
            },
            "action_cost": {
              "value": "three_actions"
            },
            "action_attack_bonus": {
              "value": 0
            },
            "action_damage_variants": {
              "value": []
            },
            "id": "048a8228-e1a9-4054-ac36-d9164652d4ed",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-29T00:33:16.641023"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Disarming Whirl"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(flourish)\n\nTakatorra spins, striking at their foes' weapons. Takatorra attempts an Athletics check to Disarm against each enemy within melee reach.\n\nEach attempt counts toward Takatorra's multiple attack penalty, but the penalty does not increase until they have made all the attempts."
            },
            "action_type": {
              "value": "none"
            },
            "action_cost": {
              "value": "two_actions"
            },
            "action_attack_bonus": {
